* import feed list from notes/wiki/feeds.opml; if unavailable, manual setup:
  * top left -> plus sign -> Category -> type 'Blogs'
  * top left -> plus sign -> Category -> type 'Mastodon'
    * add all Mastodon feeds here
    * 'Mastodon' category -> right click -> Edit -> Mute Notifications
  * 'Blogs' should be before 'Mastodon'; if not, drag one on to the other to
    switch the order
* top left -> hamburger menu -> Preferences -> Appearance -> Spring
* top right -> three dots -> Line Height -> slider to lowest tick
